      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am colorblind, and I also have trouble telling New Users and trusted users at a glance, I have to stop and mouse over them to see.\n\nAt least make ranks closer, maybe even use WoW loot color as a frame of reference\n\nBeing able to color them yourself would also be nice too.\n\nVisitors - Grey (common items)\nNew Users - Green (uncommon items)\nKnown Users - Light blue (instead of a straight blue) (rare items)\nTrusted Users - Purple (or even Magenta) (epic Items)\nFriends - Gold (Legendary)\nAdmins - Red (Artifact items)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-04T19:46:47.986Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "My friend is color blind and has a hard time telling green and yellow nameplates apart, as well as blue and purple. It would be nice if there were options for color blind people, or the option to customize rank colors in general.",
